t":0},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"CyTi85R8nwNjmAESGNr0Aw","review_id":"XBFBHHhl7-6L18pDAD65_w","date":"2017-08-25T14:50:23","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.94394850730896,"text_excerpt":"This bar is 2 blocks from my office so I go here about once a week. The bartenders are usually very attentive and friendly. They have a nice wine and beer selection. The last time I went there I was pleasantly surprised by their craft cocktail menu. I highly recommend the gin cocktail with the cucumber. It is truly out of this world. I have never ordered from the food menu so I can't comment on that. It seems decent. If you are staying at the Aloft or passing by and wanting a beverage, I recommend this bar. Cheers!"},{"business_id":"CyTi85R8nwNjmAESGNr0Aw","review_id":"aQ8EVc2JqVoqUQcuba0vRA","date":"2018-11-28T18:28:07","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9313300848007202,"text_excerpt":"Very good experience here. Bartenders are very nice with lots of personality. My favorite drink here is the Voodoo Voo during happy hour!! Delicious!!! I also had a very good mimosa here too on Sunday."},{"business_id":"CyTi85R8nwNjmAESGNr0Aw","review_id":"K-9_2552RZ79uNsIVccFjQ","date":"2015-12-13T15:28:37","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9218751192092896,"text_excerpt":"My husband and I walked in here about 1:00 am on a weekend. This place has only been open for about 8 months so their weren't that many people. It's like a sophisticated Barcadia as they have many games available for their guests entertainment. I saw Jenga, Chess, Checkers, tic-tac-toe, Connect 4, and Cards Against Humanity. The bar is very well decorated, modern but very comfy, and the service is great. Drinks are delicious and well made. Some of the bartenders wear pink. It's always nice to see men in pink. I would suggest you come in this place soon before it gets too crowded. I'm sure it will. It has all the components to be great!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"CyTi85R8nwNjmAESGNr0Aw","photo_id":"YK1xS5ZR7XQMGjIfboKgFQ","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/YK1xS5ZR7XQMGjIfboKgFQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9195924997329712},{"business_id":"CyTi85R8nwNjmAESGNr0Aw","photo_id":"1WZsIBF8d4Cx2M-GBQI4Bw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/1WZsIBF8d4Cx2M-GBQI4Bw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.9082531332969666},{"business_id":"CyTi85R8nwNjmAESGNr0Aw","photo_id":"mu2SwQCmcHh8YtEcPKPefg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/mu2SwQCmcHh8YtEcPKPefg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8114562034606934},{"business_id":"CyTi85R8nwNjmAESGNr0Aw","photo_id":"GSEFkHuU1mCk1vXO1c0yAQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/GSEFkHuU1mCk1vXO1c0yAQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.6576009392738342}]},"notebook_case":null}
